             <h3>Master Client Communication</h3>\n                    <p>Build strong client relationships and manage expectations effectively.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_2.jpg\" alt=\"Creative portfolio example\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Build a Portfolio That Wows</h3>\n                    <p>Curate and present your work to attract ideal clients and projects.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_3.jpg\" alt=\"Pricing strategy illustration\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Price Your Creative Work</h3>\n                    <p>Set rates confidently that reflect your true value and expertise.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_4.jpg\" alt=\"Meaningful conversation\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Networking for Introverts</h3>\n                    <p>Actionable tips to build meaningful connections without the overwhelm.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n             <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_5.jpg\" alt=\"Time management tools\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Freelancer Time Management</h3>\n                    <p>Boost productivity and maintain work-life balance with proven strategies.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_6.jpg\" alt=\"Signed contract\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Understanding Contracts</h3>\n                    <p>Protect your work. Key elements every freelance contract needs for clarity.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_7.jpg\" alt=\"Self-promotion concept\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Marketing Your Creative Skills</h3>\n                    <p>Authentic ways to market your skills and attract the right clients.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info\">\n                    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"box\">\n                <img src=\"Images/Pics/f_8.jpg\" alt=\"Feedback bubbles\">\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <h3>Handling Client Feedback</h3>\n                    <p>Turn feedback into an opportunity for growth and stronger collaborations.</p